# Everything that should not enter a Docker build context.
#
# Build strategy: the monorepo is built LOCALLY (api `nest build`, dashboard
# `next build` with NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096). Docker DOES NOT
# rebuild — its Dockerfile just COPYs the pre-built artifacts (dist/, .next/,
# node_modules/) and installs OS-level packages. Excluding these from the
# context would prevent that COPY strategy from working.
#
# Therefore we NO LONGER exclude **/dist, **/.next, **/node_modules, **/.turbo.
# The build context can be large; mitigate by keeping the repo lean and
# rebuilding the context rarely (only when artifacts change).
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docs
